{
  "id": "041",
  "title": "The Pill and the Flaw",
  "subtitle": "\"Every pill I refined had one flaw. My master said to fix it. My master had never refined a pill in his life. I kept the flaw. I became the most dangerous alchemist in the Azure Mountain Sect.\"",
  "penName": "Luo Ziyan",
  "genre": "cultivationXianxia",
  "hook": "I was born in the Lower Realm in a village that had never seen a cultivator. I arrived at Azure Mountain Sect at fourteen as the last-chosen disciple of Elder Mu, the sect's Alchemy Master — a position considered secondary, safe, unambitious. Every pill I refined carried a flaw my master told me to eliminate. I studied the flaws instead. By the time I was seventeen, my flawed pills were doing things no other alchemist's pills did. My junior sister Wen fell into demonic corruption. My flawed Soul-Clarity Pill was the only pill in the Azure Mountains that could save her.",
